  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In triangle <math alttext=\"upper A upper B upper C\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>A</mi>\n\t<mi>B</mi>\n\t<mi>C</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>, angle <math alttext=\"upper B\"><mi>B</mi>\n</math> is a right angle. The length of side <math alttext=\"upper A upper B\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>A</mi>\n\t<mi>B</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"10 StartRoot 37 EndRoot\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>10</mn>\n\t<msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>37</mn>\n\t</msqrt>\n</mrow>\n</math> and the length of side <math alttext=\"upper B upper C\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>B</mi>\n\t<mi>C</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"24 StartRoot 37 EndRoot\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>24</mn>\n\t<msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>37</mn>\n\t</msqrt>\n</mrow>\n</math>. What is the length of side <math alttext=\"upper A upper C\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>A</mi>\n\t<mi>C</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
